      ],
      "source": "https://encyclopediaofalabama.org/article/citronelle/"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Lieutenant General Richard Taylor surrendered one of the last significant Confederate armies under the Surrender Oak on May 4, 1865.",
